=== prompt
Given the sequence [1 2 3 4], build a new sequence with every element doubled and log the new sequence (as one value).
=== expected
[2 4 6 8]
=== reference
[1 2 3 4] = xs
[] | Var(out)
0 | Var(i)
xs | Count = n
While({i | IsLess(n)} { xs | Take(i) | Math.Multiply(2) | Push(out) Inc(i) })
out | Log
